OL,3,GNEWSAFlowers laid after fatal pub
OL,4,Astabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes have been left at the scene
OL,7,Fwhere a man died after being stabbed at
OL,8,Fa pub in Sutton Coldfield.
OL,10,FFlowers and cards were laid at the
OL,11,FBeggars Bush pub on Chester Road, where
OL,12,Fthe man, who was in his 20s, was
OL,13,Ffatally injured in the car park.
OL,15,FEmergency services were called to the
OL,16,Fvenue shortly before 02:00 BST on
OL,17,FSunday, but he was pronounced dead at
OL,18,Fthe scene.
OL,20,FWest Midlands Police are continuing a
OL,21,Fmurder investigation and have appealed
OL,22,Ffor witnesses to come forward.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
